{
 "_createdAt": "2026-04-27T19:20:08Z",
 "_id": "wp-post-134663-en",
 "_rev": "S0nWQbQfCu6sjLYYx5pLN3",
 "_type": "article",
 "_updatedAt": "2026-11-09T18:01:04Z",
 "author": {
  "_ref": "author-legacy-archive",
  "_type": "reference"
 },
 "body": [
  {
   "_key": "000000000001",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000000",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "July in Egypt is a hot season."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000003",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "l2f7ojfv93el",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "This isn't light caution. In Upper Egypt especially — "
    },
    {
     "_key": "x91vdj0k4j13",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "ti5evrr6fadj"
     ],
     "text": "Luxor"
    },
    {
     "_key": "88gdmfuejcxn",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", "
    },
    {
     "_key": "wsi1kwbib54g",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "ez9nsy4y73sg"
     ],
     "text": "Aswan"
    },
    {
     "_key": "lckpuoenodld",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", "
    },
    {
     "_key": "9fhvvfkjixp2",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "ox600bumymez"
     ],
     "text": "Abu Simbel"
    },
    {
     "_key": "dadqtjkvt7v7",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " — daytime outdoor sightseeing becomes quite harsh. Temples and valleys hold little shade, and the glare off stone and sand is strong."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "ti5evrr6fadj",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58877",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "ez9nsy4y73sg",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58758",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "ox600bumymez",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-56813",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000005",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "w17nfftzj59d",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Still, July isn't a month to avoid entirely. International tourists are fewer than winter, and sites can be quiet. The Red Sea works well for sea-centred holidays. Mediterranean cities like "
    },
    {
     "_key": "xc2w2au3vu5u",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "iiaveuv3cuvq"
     ],
     "text": "Alexandria"
    },
    {
     "_key": "38slxvcaye9k",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " show a different summer Egypt from the interior."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "iiaveuv3cuvq",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58750",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000007",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000006",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "What matters in a July trip is not using a winter itinerary as-is. Time of day, destinations, and how to insert rest need to change."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000009",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000008",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "How to think about July heat"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000000b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000000a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Egypt's July heat differs in quality by region."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000000d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "bjx8gf2ryf3p",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "rjla77iiazmr"
     ],
     "text": "Cairo"
    },
    {
     "_key": "dxs7v187gd57",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " and "
    },
    {
     "_key": "dyvo0fw2x2w2",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "1oelyb1co36x"
     ],
     "text": "Giza"
    },
    {
     "_key": "ol0aqr2820mw",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " are hot, but combining indoor facilities and museums makes an itinerary work. Visit "
    },
    {
     "_key": "exriyicyywcn",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "xkju8fkqlahe"
     ],
     "text": "the Giza plateau"
    },
    {
     "_key": "62q01jlqpfxu",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " in the morning and place the Grand Egyptian Museum or "
    },
    {
     "_key": "e4bquigucgy1",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "avsenv49f9q1"
     ],
     "text": "the National Museum"
    },
    {
     "_key": "grlg4e14rrq7",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " of Egyptian Civilization in midday — you move much more easily."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "rjla77iiazmr",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "1oelyb1co36x",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "xkju8fkqlahe",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.giza.the-giza-plateau",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "avsenv49f9q1",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.alexandria.alexandria-national-museum",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000000f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "gq0acotzo41i",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Luxor and Aswan need the most caution. Concentrate outdoor sites in early morning; plan for late morning through afternoon as rest hours. "
    },
    {
     "_key": "gidwttj25vaz",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "mcqnc5stdka8"
     ],
     "text": "Valley of the Kings"
    },
    {
     "_key": "2kbr7urt8tmh",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", Karnak, Hatshepsut, Philae — all valuable, none places to walk at midday."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "mcqnc5stdka8",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.valley-of-the-kings",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000011",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0eqnpuyffez4",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The Red Sea coast suits July relatively well. In "
    },
    {
     "_key": "spzxlfauhiql",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "nylagg35mrrt"
     ],
     "text": "Hurghada"
    },
    {
     "_key": "f59sd4z8yt4u",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", Sharm el-Sheikh, and "
    },
    {
     "_key": "1ibff6wh3twb",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "tq234ffcyi79"
     ],
     "text": "Marsa Alam"
    },
    {
     "_key": "zznwsubam493",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", sea, pool, snorkelling, diving, and resort stay form the trip's centre, so heat lands differently than at inland sites."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "nylagg35mrrt",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "tq234ffcyi79",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58885",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000013",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000012",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Alexandria and the Mediterranean coast can feel easier than the interior. But Egyptian domestic summer demand crowds the city — think of it as a summer city rather than a quiet escape."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000015",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000014",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Western Desert and oases are harsh in July. For White Desert or Siwa visits, time of day, transfer, lodging facilities, and local guide judgment matter. On first short trips, you can lower their priority."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000017",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000016",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Itineraries suited to July"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000019",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000018",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The easiest July construction is combining Cairo and Red Sea."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000001b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000001a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Cairo for Giza, GEM, part of Islamic Cairo; then Hurghada or Sharm el-Sheikh for sea time. This composition pairs well with heat."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000001d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "dqt5nmo32hyk",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For ancient-Egypt focus, Cairo and Luxor combine too. But in Luxor, use only morning for site visits and plan on hotel rest in midday. Adding evening "
    },
    {
     "_key": "ak37khc06zee",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "7shmvvqh8xez"
     ],
     "text": "Luxor Temple"
    },
    {
     "_key": "lewr7p5mdvqm",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " or Nile-side time lets you feel the city while avoiding daytime severity."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "7shmvvqh8xez",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.the-luxor-temple",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000001f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000001e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "With ten days or more, Cairo, Luxor, and Red Sea is easy to manage. Adding Aswan or Abu Simbel needs more margin."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000021",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000020",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Short itineraries trying to include Cairo, Luxor, Aswan, Abu Simbel, and the Red Sea become very heavy in July. Transfer and heat stack — you can tire before enjoying the sights."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000023",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000022",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "How to use a day"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000025",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000024",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "In July Egypt, the first few hours of the day decide things."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000027",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000026",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "See outdoor sites in the morning. Leave early; finish main visits before heat builds. Use midday for hotel, museum, air-conditioned restaurant, pool, transfer, or nap. Go out again from evening into night."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000029",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000028",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "This rhythm isn't only for comfort. It is practical body-protection."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000002b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "2bn1uc8uvs04",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "In Cairo — Giza in the morning, museum at midday, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "z63oqk799qjy",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "d9invifk1xqi"
     ],
     "text": "Khan el-Khalili"
    },
    {
     "_key": "shv04f0ou27l",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " or Nile-side in the evening. In Luxor — west bank early, rest at midday, Luxor Temple or felucca in the evening. In Aswan — Philae in the morning, Nubian Museum or hotel at midday, Nile islands in the evening."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "d9invifk1xqi",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.cairo.khan-el-khalili",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000002d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000002c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "People who run July trips well don't cut sights — they choose when to see them."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000002f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000002e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Cairo and Giza"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000031",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000030",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "July Cairo needs outdoor-indoor balance."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000033",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000032",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Visit the Giza pyramids early morning. The plateau is wide, shade scarce, and you exhaust later. If entering the Great Pyramid, schedule early for heat and crowds."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000035",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000034",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The Grand Egyptian Museum is easy to use in July Cairo. Indoors, you can follow the flow of ancient Egypt and put hot hours to good use. Confirm hours, tickets, and access conditions on official information before visiting."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000037",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000036",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Islamic Cairo and Khan el-Khalili walk more easily from evening on. Avoiding daytime heat, the night fits cafés and market air."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000039",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000038",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Don't forget transfers take time in Cairo. Repeated movement through traffic on a hot day exhausts you alone. Narrowing the day to one area matters."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000003b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000003a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Luxor"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000003d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000003c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "July Luxor suits early-morning trip people."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000003f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000003e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Visit the Valley of the Kings as early as possible. Tomb interiors can feel cooler than outside, but the whole valley grows harsh as the sun climbs. Choosing which tombs to enter rather than stacking three or four leaves stronger impressions."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000041",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "is603psmupr7",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Hatshepsut, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "ro3w0mjhqngo",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "g84e1y7yc5ju"
     ],
     "text": "Medinet Habu"
    },
    {
     "_key": "c3o6ce8o0uj3",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", and Deir el-Medina also suit morning. All valuable; with little shade, late-time visits aren't recommended."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "g84e1y7yc5ju",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.madinat-habu-temple",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000043",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000042",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Karnak too is morning-default. The Great Hypostyle Hall makes some shade, but the temple is wide and midday walking heavy."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000045",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000044",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Evening Luxor Temple is a good July choice. Post-sunset lighting, city sound, and the stone's colour combine for a striking time even in hot season."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000047",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000046",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Staying in Luxor, weigh air conditioning, pool, and a location easy to return to at midday. July time spent in the hotel grows long, so lodging comfort sets trip quality."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000049",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000048",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Aswan and Abu Simbel"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000004b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000004a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Aswan gets very hot in July. Even so, the Nile scenery, Philae, Nubian Museum, and island atmosphere have large appeal."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000004d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000004c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Visit Philae in the morning. The boat ride itself feels good, but inside the temple outdoor time is long. The Nubian Museum suits midday."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000004f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000004e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For July Abu Simbel, plan carefully. Transfer is long and the site itself sees strong sun, so don't pack other plans that day. With stamina concerns or with children, gentler Aswan time can be the choice."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000051",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000050",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "In Aswan, evening Nile saves things. Felucca, short island crossings, riverside walks — keep them as time separate from site touring."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000053",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000052",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The Red Sea"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000055",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000054",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The Red Sea is one of the most naturally enjoyable July regions in Egypt."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000057",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000056",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "In Sharm el-Sheikh, Hurghada, and Marsa Alam, heat exists, but entering the sea is the trip's centre. Snorkelling, diving, boat trips, pool, and hotel rest are the main use of time."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000059",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000058",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Choosing Red Sea, confirm hotel sea access. Sand entry, jetty to reef, areas easy for children, a house reef suited to snorkelling — star ratings don't tell you this."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000005b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000005a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For diving, choose sites matching your experience. The Red Sea has gentle beginner places and current-prone advanced sites. Confirm safety briefings, equipment, guide ratios, and the day's conditions."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000005d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000005c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Sun is strong; don't relax at the shore. Hat, rash guard, sunscreen, hydration matter."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000005f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000005e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Alexandria"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000061",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000060",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "July Alexandria shows a different summer Egypt from the interior."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000063",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000062",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Mediterranean coast climate can feel easier than Cairo or Luxor. But Egyptian domestic travellers come too, and the beach and Corniche stay busy. Treat it as a summer city, not a quiet escape."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000065",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000064",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Qaitbay Citadel, Kom el-Shoqafa catacombs, Roman Theatre, and Bibliotheca Alexandrina combine into a one- or two-night trip from Cairo."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000067",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000066",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "On short first trips it can drop in priority; for those wanting Mediterranean Egypt while avoiding heat, it's a good candidate."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000069",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000068",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Clothing and gear"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000006b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000006a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For July, think both cool and sun-blocking in dress."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000006d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000006c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Thin breathable long sleeves, light colours, hat, sunglasses, walking shoes — the basics. Sun-blocking clothes can feel easier than exposed skin."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000006f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000006e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "At religious sites and local-life areas, modest dress covering shoulders and knees fits. A light scarf is useful for women."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000071",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000070",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Carry water always. Buy before outdoor visits and keep extra in the car. Prepare oral rehydration, stomach medicine, after-sun care, and any regular medication."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000073",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000072",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Sunscreen once in the morning isn't enough. Sweat and water remove it — carry it on the assumption you'll reapply."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000075",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000074",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "What to avoid in July"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000077",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000076",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Avoid itineraries centred on midday outdoor sightseeing."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000079",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000078",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Walking Giza at noon. Touring Karnak in the afternoon. Stacking Hatshepsut and Medinet Habu late after the Valley of the Kings. Adding another site after returning from Abu Simbel. These compositions are physically harsh."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000007b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000007a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Avoid stacking too much transfer in short periods. In hot season, wait time, car movement, and airport transfer all add fatigue."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000007d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000007c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "In July, reducing plans raises trip quality. Better to see one well-timed sight than to fit three. That judgment matters."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000007f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000007e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Is July worth it"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000081",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000080",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "If you can freely choose the season, October to April is easier for Egypt's site travel. Especially weighing Luxor and Aswan, cool months are more natural."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000083",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000082",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Still — for those who can only rest in July, who weigh the Red Sea, who want to avoid crowds, who don't mind early-morning action — July Egypt holds up."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000085",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000084",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Strengths: quiet sites, easier lodging, sea travel, evening city atmosphere. Weaknesses: strong heat, limited daytime activity."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000087",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000086",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "July Egypt isn't a comfortable season. But built right, it isn't a season to give up travel either."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000089",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000088",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Care for the morning, rest at midday, narrow the destinations. Hold these basics and July Egypt offers a quiet and margin you don't find in other seasons."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  }
 ],
